ai_context: 'This topic models no cross-table joins.

  Domain definitions for this topic:

  - Equipment Effectiveness Ratio (EER): EER = \frac{\text{SQS} \times EquipStatus\_value}{\text{Battery Level (%)} \times (101 - EquipAge\_days) / 365} \times 25, \text{ where SQS is the Scan Quality Score, EquipStatus_value is 1.0 for ''Excellent'' to 0.2 for ''Poor'', and EquipAge_days is days since \text{Calibration Date}, with higher values indicating more efficient use of equipment relative to condition.}'
